                                "sense_id": "8243e10d-a4d7-30e8-9ae1-61a58e3f8332",
                                "text": "[…] tissue was disrupted using a Moulinex liquidizer and 0-5% bovine serum albumin was added to the isolating and resuspending media."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af8a1980-f1f7-4a5e-810b-0545face9e72",
                                "sense_id": "8243e10d-a4d7-30e8-9ae1-61a58e3f8332",
                                "text": "She bought herself a second-hand Mini and in no time at all was busy as a bee, driving herself around London with pots and pans, cooking knives and liquidizers all piled up on the back seat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68b44d1a-1267-4d95-88ca-f4b22dd74573",
                                "sense_id": "8243e10d-a4d7-30e8-9ae1-61a58e3f8332",
                                "text": "Place a cupful of the soaked beans in a liquidizer, add a cupful of cold water and blend."
                            }
                        ]
